WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.790
Saul carries letters from the high priest.

2
00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:06.900
His task: arrest followers
of the Way in Damascus.

3
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:10.200
He has already dragged men
and women off to prison.

4
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:13.370
Near Damascus, something
stops him on the road.

5
00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.920
Within days, he is baptised.

6
00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:19.240
So what changed the man
hunting Jesus' followers,

7
00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:21.290
and where did he go next?

8
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:25.310
In this mission, you'll compare
three accounts of that road in Acts,

9
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.140
and two ways of reading it.

10
00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:29.860
Then you'll trace three
journeys on the map:

11
00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:33.640
Cyprus, Philippi, Corinth and Ephesus.

12
00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:36.720
Your mission: find out what changed Saul,

13
00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.530
and where his journeys took him.
